  location: "옛 운반 통로"
  background: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3bef652f35f44da6aa9330e3a4373ba7, type: 3}
  backgroundUv: {serializedVersion: 2, x: 0.5, y: 0.578125, width: 0.5, height: 0.421875}
  lines:
  - speaker: "서진"
    text: "들것과 작은 신발…… 사부님이 구하셨던 사람들이 이곳을 지나갔구나."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 0}
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "서진"
    text: "수로 도면 아래에 청계역이 있어. 수문이 열리면 지나온 마을들이 잠기겠어."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: 5
    evidenceTitle: "수문 아래의 마을들"
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "서진"
    text: "요새 입구는 이 통로 끝이다. 서둘러야 해."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 0}
